---
/* Hero.astro - the opening section: one product photograph with the
   headline, "View products" and "Enquire" (WhatsApp or call, see
   Enquire.astro) beside it (computers) or above it (phones).

   Layout agreed with Daniel and ChatGPT ("Direction A, Refinement 02"):
   - Screens 900 px and wider: the wide photo fills about 65% of the width on
     the left; a warm-white panel with the text fills the rest.
   - Phones and narrow tablets: the warm-white panel with the text comes
     first, and the tall photo starts right under the buttons. The top of the
     tall photo is plain wall, so it fades into the panel and text and photo
     read as one picture.
   - Text left-aligned; plain button labels. "Enquire" opens a choice of
     WhatsApp or a call (16 Nov 2026); the number stays visible in Contact.
   - Brand identity V1.1 (17 Nov 2026): the page behind is neutral concrete,
     so on phones the photo now fades out at the bottom as well as the top.

   The photos (Sunburst renders of the real products, Nov 2026) are in
   public/images/hero/, each in several widths: the browser downloads only
   the size the screen needs. Phones get the tall photo, wider screens the
   wide one, via <picture>. width/height give the shape so the browser can
   reserve the space before the photo arrives. */
import Enquire from "./Enquire.astro";

/** Description of the hero photo; also used for link previews (Base.astro). */
export const HERO_ALT =
  "Bags of Supacem, Dzata and Ghacem cement beside strapped bundles of iron rods and coils of binding wire";

const desktopSrcset = [960, 1440, 1920, 2560]
  .map((w) => `/images/hero/hero-desktop-${w}.webp ${w}w`)
  .join(", ");
const phoneSrcset = [480, 780, 1024]
  .map((w) => `/images/hero/hero-phone-${w}.webp ${w}w`)
  .join(", ");
---
<section class="hero" id="home">
<picture class="hpic">
<source media="(max-width:899px)" srcset={phoneSrcset} sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="1280">
<img src="/images/hero/hero-desktop-1440.webp" srcset={desktopSrcset} sizes="(min-width:900px) 65vw, 100vw" width="2560" height="1440" alt={HERO_ALT} fetchpriority="high">
</picture>
<div class="htx"><p class="kick">Building materials supplier</p><h1>Materials for stronger construction.</h1><p class="lead">Cement, iron rods and binding wire, delivered to your site.</p><div class="ctas"><a class="cta" href="#products">View products</a><Enquire id="enq-hero" variant="secondary" /></div></div>
</section>
